# Python on D:\

- Match existing project style before adding patterns
- Prefer stdlib + existing deps over new packages
- `pip` is the default package manager
- Keep scripts runnable from repo root
- Use env vars or vault secrets — never hardcode tokens
- For long-running bots: log clearly, fail safe, avoid silent swallow
- ffmpeg / Whisper paths: check project note in `D:\MyVault\Projects/`
